# Accepted advisories (rationale in SECURITY.md).
#
# nanoid < 3.3.18 DoS / predictable-id. The only path to nanoid is the transitive
# hunspell-asm > emscripten-wasm-loader, whose single call site is nanoid(45) — a fixed, positive
# size, run server-side and never from user input — so none of these are reachable. There is no
# safe upgrade: nanoid 3.x drops the function-style default export that emscripten-wasm-loader
# needs, which breaks the spell checker. Revisit when hunspell-asm moves off nanoid 2.x.
CVE-2026-67213
CVE-2026-67214
CVE-2026-73086
